Third-party components

index.html embeds open-source map components (MapLibre GL JS, PMTiles,
@protomaps/basemaps, the libraries they include, and Noto Sans label glyphs).
They are not covered by the license above: each stays under its own license
(BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause, MIT, ISC, or the SIL Open Font License 1.1 for the
font glyphs).
Their copyright notices and full license texts are in the About tab of
index.html and are listed in README.md. indexRFD.html contains no third-party
code.
